{{- define "wake_audit_remediation" -}}
Audit findings classified as REMEDIATE_WITH_TASK need new remediation tasks.
The auditor has identified issues that should be fixed in dedicated tasks.

YOUR TASK:
1. Read the blackboard to see all unresolved REMEDIATE_WITH_TASK audit findings
2. For each finding without a linked remediation task:
   a. Create a new task to address the issue (use liza_add_task)
   b. IMPORTANT: Pass "origin_finding_id" with the finding's ID (e.g. "cli-001") to auto-link the finding
   c. The task description should reference the audit finding
   d. Include the finding's evidence and recommended action
   e. Ensure the task has proper acceptance criteria and verify commands
3. After creating all remediation tasks, update sprint metrics

Do NOT create a sprint checkpoint. The remediation tasks need to be completed first.
{{- end -}}
